<title>SINGAPORE: Rotol 1996 net profit falls 31.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Rotol 1996 net profit falls 31.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.86  vs   4.20</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)			 8.00  vs   8.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    3.49  vs   5.12</p>
<p>    Turnover				21.79  vs  29.71</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	2.99  vs   0.35</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.08  vs   0.25</p>
<p>    Depreciation &amp; amortisation	1.07  vs   0.99</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 4.36  vs   7.13</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		 0.20  vs   0.87</p>
<p>    Tax					1.22  vs   2.01</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (loss) 0.08  vs   0.05 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Rotol Singapore Ltd designs and makes aluminium claddings, curtain walls and skylights.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
